     "status": "carried_out",
     "excerpt": "I’ve proposed a 7% S2 limit with regulator oversight, prompt corrective action and retesting, and an S5 structure where 8/100k triggers prompt regulator review and corrective action, while mandatory recall begins at 10/100k or earlier for imminent serious risk.",
