      "S5_customer_disclosure"
     ],
     "comparison": "S2 permanent limit 7% vs answer-key maximum 5% (weakened, benefits Northwind); S5 mandatory recall at 10/100k vs required 8/100k (weakened, benefits Halcyon). Each company gets a section that benefits it weakened below the acceptable range."
